          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            10. Matching the Flavor to Your Goal
          </h2>

          <p>
            <strong>For daily use:</strong> Unflavored. It has one ingredient, no sweetener and the lowest lead figure Equip publishes. Blend it into a smoothie with fruit and a milk alternative, stir it into coffee, or add it to soups and baking. A scoop and a quarter gets you to about 25 g of protein.
